{{also|Schnäbel}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|snabel}}, from {{inh|de|goh|snabul}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*snabulaz||snout, muzzle}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*ksnew-||to scratch, rub}}. Cognate with {{cog|stq|Snoabel||beak, bill}}, {{cog|ang|snofl||mucus, snivel}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈʃnaːbl̩/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Schnabel.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|m||Schnäbel|Schnäbelchen|dim2=Schnäblein}}

# [[beak]], [[bill]], [[pecker]]
# [[spout]]

====Declension====
{{de-decl-noun-m|s|pl=Schnäbel}}

